  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that using scvi_n200 RNA encoder, imagenet_vit_l image encoder, transformer aggregation, and weighted fusion achieves high accuracy (0.725). This experiment tests whether replacing the image encoder with resnet50 (while keeping other parameters the same) impacts performance, isolating the effect of the image encoder choice. This clarifies whether the previously observed success depends on the specific image encoder, balancing exploration of critical design choices with exploitation of promising directions."
